The curses from spellcasters (or when you killed The Wizard) can be cured
by holy water (for one [stack of] item[s]), or by a scroll or spell of
remove curse (for wielded, worn items), or by a blessed scroll of remove
curse (for all items in the inventory) or by zapping a wand of cancellation
at your items (for all items that don't have "charges"; specifically don't
use that on wands, precious scrolls, potions, or spellbooks, enchanted
armor and weapon if you don't want the enchantment to vanish).

